<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Paint 1996 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Paint 1996 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>					Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss     32.06	vs   Loss    12.68</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss    577.37	vs   Loss   228.15</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited. Bangkok Paint Plc is a paint manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
